<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Wedlock Admin Password Reset Success</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f6f8;
            color: #333;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 650px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            border-top: 6px solid #007EAF;
        }

        .header {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            background-color: #007EAF;
        }

        .header img {
            max-width: 180px;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 30px 40px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        h2 {
            margin: 0 0 10px;
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #007EAF;
        }

        h3 {
            margin: 10px 0;
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #444;
        }

        p {
            margin: 10px 0;
            color: #555;
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        ul {
            margin: 15px 0 15px 20px;
            padding: 0;
            color: #555;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .heart {
            color: #e63946;
        }

        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #999;
            padding: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
        }

        .footer a {
            color: #007EAF;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        /* Mobile responsiveness */
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .content {
                padding: 20px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="header">
            <a href="https://wedlock.com.au">
                <img src="https://wedlock.com.au/wedlock-img.jpg" alt="Wedlock Logo">
            </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Main Content -->
        <div class="content">
            <h2>Hello <span id="name"><%= name %></span>,</h2>
            <h3>Password Updated</h3>
            <p>Your Wedlock Admin password was successfully reset on <%= date %>.</p>

            <p>If you initiated this change, you can now log in with your new password. If you didn't make this change, please contact our support team immediately.</p>

            <p>For your security, remember to:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Never share your password with anyone</li>
                <li>Use a unique password that isn't used elsewhere</li>
                <li>Change your password periodically</li>
            </ul>

            <p>With <span class="heart">♥</span>, The Wedlock Admin Team</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="footer">
            <p>© 2025 Wedlock Admin Portal. All rights reserved.</p>
            <p><a href="https://admin.wedlock.com.au">https://admin.wedlock.com.au</a></p>
            <p>Need help? <a href="mailto:IT-support@wedlock.com.au">Contact our support team</a></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>
